// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x001A5460 size=75 name=?Rva001A5460@Animatable3DObjClass@@UAEXPAV1@@Z evidence=?:placeholder tier=B hypothesis:cohesion
void Animatable3DObjClass::_bfme_ro_v56(RenderObjClass *source)
{
	// Only an object that has a hierarchy of its own can be followed.
	if (source) {
		if (source->Get_HTree() == NULL) {
			source = NULL;
		}
	}
	if (source != HTreeSourceObj) {
		if (source) {
			source->Add_Ref();
		}
		if (HTreeSourceObj) {
			HTreeSourceObj->Release_Ref();
		}
		HTreeSourceObj = source;
	}
}

